  "journal": {
    "monument": {
      "title": "The Stone That Remembers",
      "text": "The monument is far bigger than it looked from the watchtower; the tremors have uncovered walls that were buried for generations. We rebuilt the fallen stair, copied three carved panels and measured the split in the central pillar. Behind a slump of earth: six structures carved around a circle. Elara knows one as the towers of Eldervale, Bram another as the old Stonecrown fortress. When I leaned close, light ran through the pillar's carved lines before my hand ever reached it. Orin took a fallen fragment back to study."
    }
  }
